<title>UK: Lehman Brothers sets warrants on the S&amp;P 500 index.</title>
<headline>Lehman Brothers sets warrants on the S&amp;P 500 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers Finance SA has issued 35 million American-style call and put warrants, in seven equal tranches, on the S&amp;P 500 index, lead manager Lehman Brothers Holdings Inc said.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one index.</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 25.OCT.96-19.JUN.98   PAYDATE	24.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUX			 MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE	ISS PRICE    PREMIUM	  GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	  675.0	 $9.76	  13.01 PCT	11.0 X</p>
<p> CALL B	  700.0	 $8.18	   8.01 PCT	13.0 X</p>
<p> CALL C	  725.0	 $6.78	   3.14 PCT	16.0 X</p>
<p> PUT D	   650.0	 $2.77	  10.08 PCT	39.0 X</p>
<p> PUT E	   675.0	 $3.51	   7.21 PCT	31.0 X</p>
<p> PUT F	   700.0	 $4.32	   4.41 PCT	25.0 X</p>
<p> PUT G	   725.0	 $5.66	   2.10 PCT	19.0 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
